    "identifier": "lightning-release-lightning-spear",
    "description": "<p>You create a concentrated globe of lightning around your hand, and point it in a direction of your choice. A beam of lightning shoots at blinding speeds in a straight-line piercing through everything in its path.</p>\n<p>All creatures in a 5-foot wide, 60-foot-long line must make a dexterity saving throw. On a failed save affected creatures take 6d6 lightning damage and gain 2 ranks of Shaken. On a success, they take half as much damage and no further effects.</p>\n<p>Overcharge. A creature that fails their saving throw becomes Restrained in place until the beginning of your next turn as you hold them in place.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and increase the damage by 1d6.</p>",
